WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.738
Your laptop's on the TV.

00:00:02.111 --> 00:00:02.904
Or the projector.

00:00:03.301 --> 00:00:04.130
Or across the room,

00:00:04.599 --> 00:00:05.332
running the show.

00:00:05.803 --> 00:00:06.548
You're not next to it.

00:00:06.945 --> 00:00:07.558
You don't need to be.

00:00:08.028 --> 00:00:09.758
Meet Edgepad version four.

00:00:10.131 --> 00:00:11.982
An open-source Android app that turns your

00:00:11.982 --> 00:00:13.424
phone into a trackpad,

00:00:13.797 --> 00:00:15.371
a remote and a control deck for

00:00:15.371 --> 00:00:17.078
your laptop. Windows,

00:00:17.318 --> 00:00:18.376
Mac or Linux.

00:00:19.565 --> 00:00:21.681
A companion app runs on the laptop.

00:00:22.077 --> 00:00:23.640
Pair once over Bluetooth,

00:00:23.892 --> 00:00:24.638
like a headset.

00:00:25.108 --> 00:00:26.790
No account. No server.

00:00:27.163 --> 00:00:29.194
No cloud. Your phone talks straight to

00:00:29.194 --> 00:00:29.783
your laptop.

00:00:31.232 --> 00:00:33.191
The middle is a multi-touch trackpad.

00:00:33.588 --> 00:00:34.537
One finger moves,

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:36.124
two scroll and pinch,

00:00:36.497 --> 00:00:37.747
three switch desktops,

00:00:37.759 --> 00:00:38.624
four switch apps.

00:00:39.021 --> 00:00:40.860
Every gesture is remappable.

00:00:42.343 --> 00:00:43.401
The corners are dials.

00:00:43.798 --> 00:00:45.408
Volume, brightness, zoom,

00:00:45.624 --> 00:00:47.932
video scrubbing. Flip one switch,

00:00:48.173 --> 00:00:49.182
and four become eight.

00:00:49.652 --> 00:00:51.311
The volume syncs both ways.

00:00:51.707 --> 00:00:52.681
Change it on the laptop,

00:00:53.102 --> 00:00:54.352
and the dial moves with it.

00:00:54.822 --> 00:00:56.564
Whatever's playing shows up on the pad.

00:00:56.949 --> 00:00:57.706
Pocketing your phone?

00:00:58.091 --> 00:00:59.040
Lock the trackpad,

00:00:59.305 --> 00:01:01.408
and the dials and media stay live.

00:01:02.899 --> 00:01:04.197
Tap Controls for the rest.

00:01:04.667 --> 00:01:05.460
A full keyboard,

00:01:05.664 --> 00:01:07.804
with Control, Alt and Shift you can

00:01:07.804 --> 00:01:09.054
hold or tap.

00:01:09.524 --> 00:01:11.591
A gamepad your laptop sees as a

00:01:11.591 --> 00:01:13.106
real Xbox controller,

00:01:13.526 --> 00:01:14.692
on Windows and Linux.

00:01:15.089 --> 00:01:16.772
Your games just see a controller.

00:01:17.242 --> 00:01:18.804
A pen that draws live on the

00:01:18.816 --> 00:01:21.617
laptop's screen. And a signature pad that

00:01:21.617 --> 00:01:24.032
saves a clean image for any document.

00:01:24.502 --> 00:01:25.620
Capture grabs a region,

00:01:25.897 --> 00:01:27.748
the full screen or a recording,

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:29.178
and can save it to your phone.

00:01:30.677 --> 00:01:31.939
Macros launch apps,

00:01:32.167 --> 00:01:33.393
URLs and scripts.

00:01:33.753 --> 00:01:34.643
Up to fifteen,

00:01:35.028 --> 00:01:36.842
across as many pages as you need.

00:01:37.251 --> 00:01:38.333
Bind one to a shape,

00:01:38.597 --> 00:01:39.643
draw it on the trackpad,

00:01:40.028 --> 00:01:40.857
and it fires.

00:01:41.327 --> 00:01:43.142
Clipboard sync works both ways.

00:01:43.538 --> 00:01:44.560
Text and images.

00:01:44.957 --> 00:01:45.534
From the phone,

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:47.589
come back to Edgepad and it goes.

00:01:49.010 --> 00:01:50.176
Bluetooth by default.

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:52.483
Wi-Fi and USB if you want them.

00:01:52.953 --> 00:01:54.648
Connect two laptops at once,

00:01:54.852 --> 00:01:56.415
and switch between them with a dial.

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:57.953
It keeps running in the background.

00:01:58.423 --> 00:02:00.262
The laptop holds the trust list.

00:02:00.647 --> 00:02:01.621
Approve one phone,

00:02:02.029 --> 00:02:03.592
a few, or revoke them all.

00:02:03.964 --> 00:02:05.467
Add a six-digit PIN for the first

00:02:05.479 --> 00:02:07.498
pairing, or for every connection.

00:02:09.010 --> 00:02:09.791
Then make it yours.

00:02:10.164 --> 00:02:11.318
Remap the corners,

00:02:11.522 --> 00:02:12.423
tune the dials,

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:13.469
dark or light,

00:02:13.866 --> 00:02:14.851
your own background,

00:02:15.224 --> 00:02:16.510
upright or sideways.

00:02:17.899 --> 00:02:20.231
Straight talk: Windows is tested on real

00:02:20.231 --> 00:02:22.069
hardware. Mac, Linux,

00:02:22.286 --> 00:02:24.485
Wi-Fi and USB are new and in

00:02:24.497 --> 00:02:26.348
beta. Expect bugs,

00:02:26.541 --> 00:02:28.055
and open issues when you find them.

00:02:29.565 --> 00:02:31.981
Edgepad. Free and open source.

00:02:32.366 --> 00:02:33.352
Use it, fork it,

00:02:33.496 --> 00:02:34.938
star it. It's on GitHub.

00:02:35.408 --> 00:02:37.487
Your laptop, from anywhere in the room.
